<tr><td>Personal blog (low traffic)</td><td>Yes, indefinitely</td><td>Probably never</td></tr>
<tr><td>Affiliate site (moderate traffic, no lead capture)</td><td>Yes, for 3–6 months</td><td>When message limit is hit consistently, or when lead capture is added</td></tr>
