<p>The pattern is consistent: free plans work for single-site, low-volume, question-answering use cases. Paid plans unlock the features that turn a chatbot from a Q&A tool into a lead generation and customer experience tool. The upgrade usually pays for itself — not through the monthly fee, but through the conversions the free tier leaves on the table.</p>
