<section id="free-tools">
<h2>Best Free AI Chatbot Options</h2>

<p>If you are starting out and the free tier is the right choice, here is what the leading tools offer at no cost.</p>

<p><strong>FastBots.ai (Free plan):</strong> 1 chatbot, train on 1 source (URL or text), 25 messages/month, web widget, basic analytics. The free plan is genuinely usable for a single-site setup. The training quality is good even on one source. The limitation to 25 messages makes it suitable for low-traffic sites only. Read the full breakdown in our <a href="/reviews/fastbots-ai-review/">FastBots.ai review</a>.</p>

<p><strong>Chatbase (Free plan):</strong> 1 chatbot, 30 messages/month, train on 1 source, basic customisation. Slightly more messages than FastBots on the free tier. The platform is designed for customer service use cases and includes features that make sense for businesses handling support queries. See our <a href="/reviews/chatbase-review/">Chatbase review</a> for details.</p>

<p><strong>General recommendation:</strong> Start with the tool that aligns with your primary use case. If you are building an affiliate site and want a chatbot that answers content questions, FastBots is optimised for that. If you are running a business and need customer support automation, Chatbase is purpose-built for that scenario. Both offer free plans sufficient to test the tool before committing.</p>

<p>For affiliate marketers specifically, also consider how the chatbot fits into your broader content strategy. A well-placed AI chatbot can increase time on page and capture leads that would otherwise bounce — see our guide on <a href="/blog/how-to-write-seo-content-with-ai/">writing SEO content with AI</a> for how written and conversational content work together.</p>
